    "description": {
      "content": "Nokia NetAct provides network element management APIs for telecom operators. APIs enable network topology discovery, performance monitoring, fault management, and configuration management across RAN, transport, and core network infrastructure. The NBI (Northbound Interface) exposes REST APIs for OSS/BSS integration.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Nokia Networks Support",
